  "description": "This Watercolor Fruit Garden PNG Bundle features 19 beautifully hand-painted style fruit illustrations, including blueberries, mango, blackberry, pomegranate, pear, avocado, apple, strawberry, cherries, fig, watermelon, raspberries, kiwi, lemon, dragon fruit, plum, peach, and grapes.\nDiverse collection bursting with color and life! Each illustration showcases delicate watercolor textures, vibrant natural tones, and soft artistic shading for a fresh, charming, and botanical aesthetic.\nThese watercolor fruits are perfect for farmers’ market designs, kitchen art, food blogs, recipe cards, summer celebrations, and nature-themed projects. With a cohesive artistic style and a wide variety of fruits from everyday classics to exotic picks, this bundle works beautifully for both rustic and modern designs.\nPerfect for DIY crafts ✂️, farmers market invitations 🌿, kitchen wall art 🖼️, kids books 📚, greeting cards 💌, food packaging 🍓, scrapbooking 📒, sublimation 🎨, stickers 🏷️, party décor 🎉, social media graphics 📱, planners, journals, POD products, and more.\nAll files are delivered as high-quality PNGs with transparent backgrounds, making them easy to use in Canva, Photoshop, Procreate, Cricut, Silhouette, and other design software. Simply drag, drop, and create.\n✨ Included in this bundle:\n19 high-resolution watercolor fruit PNG images\nTransparent backgrounds\n300 DPI\nInstant digital download\nPlease Note:\nThis is a digital product\nFiles may not be shared, redistributed, or resold as standalone files\nColors may vary slightly depending on screen and printer settings\nAI-assisted tools may have been used during the creative process\nPicked fresh from the garden and painted with love for your most beautiful handmade projects 🍉✨",
